    {
      "id": "s0055",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "--show-function-line=regexp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "In context and unified format, for each hunk of differences, show some of the last preceding line that matches [[p0]]. See [[p1]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "regexp"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "Showing Lines That Match Regular Expressions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0057",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "--from-file=file"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compare [[p0]] to each operand; [[p1]] may be a directory.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "file"
